  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the outdoor oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Thread kidney beans, onion, bell pepper, and tomato onto the wooden skewers",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil",
    "Sprinkle garlic powder, salt, and black pepper over the skewers",
    "Place the skewers in the outdoor oven and cook for 15 minutes",
    "Turn the skewers over and cook for an additional 10 minutes",
    "Remove the skewers from the oven and serve hot"
